Subject: net: phylink/pcs: fwnode PCS providers (OpenWrt pending-6.18 737-01..07, forward-ported to 7.3)

Needed by pcs-rtl-otto (devm_fwnode_pcs_add_provider) and the rtl83xx DSA driver
(fwnode_phylink_pcs_parse, phylink_config.fill_available_pcs). Source: OpenWrt
target/linux/generic/pending-6.18/737-0[1-7]-*.patch (Christian Marangi, under upstream review).
7.3 drift fixes:
- include/linux/phylink.h: phylink_config gained wol_* fields; pcs_interfaces,
  num_possible_pcs, fill_available_pcs re-placed around them (737-02 hunks 2-3).
- rest applies with offsets only.
